---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | ScamLens"
  description="Terms governing use of ScamLens decision-support tools and content."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
    <h1 class="display-section mt-4">Terms of Use</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-body leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
      <p><strong class="text-ink">Decision support only.</strong> ScamLens provides automated pattern analysis and educational content. It does not provide legal advice and does not determine whether any specific communication is fraudulent. Final judgement and verification through official channels are always yours.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-ink">No guarantee.</strong> Results depend on detectable patterns. A low-risk result is not a safety certificate; a high-risk result is not proof. We disclaim liability for decisions made based on output.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-ink">Acceptable use.</strong> Don't use ScamLens to harass, accuse individuals, or automate bulk scanning. Never contact suspected scammers based on our output.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-ink">Content licence.</strong> Safety tips and library articles may be shared freely for non-commercial education with attribution appreciated.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-ink">Reporting fraud.</strong> For actual financial loss, contact cybercrime.gov.in or call 1930. ScamLens cannot recover funds or investigate cases.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-10 text-caption text-ink-tertiary">Last updated August 2026 · scamlens.in</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
